  ScriptLevel->0,
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "757421fd-ba06-2741-85f4-84bd474fef89"],
 " are real."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->212890209,ExpressionUUID->"e5200e1c-7aa1-7648-89ec-6bef43f17130"]
}, Closed]],

